// HarnessListSessions keyset-paginated on an opaque cursor. Results are scoped to the authenticated team. Destroyed and failed sessions are omitted by default (matching the Cloud Console); pass `status=SESSION_STATUS_ALL` to list every session regardless of status, or an explicit status such as `status=SESSION_STATUS_FAILED` or `status=SESSION_STATUS_DESTROYED` to list only those.
//
// Parameters:
//
